 "questionType": "단답형",
 "content": "다음 곱셈을 하시오.\n⑴ $3x^{3}\\times 7y^{2}$\n⑵ $-4xy^{4}\\times x^{3}y^{2}$\n⑶ $6ab^{5}\\times\\left(\\frac{a}{b^{2}}\\right)^{2}$\n⑷ $(-2a^{2}b)^{3}\\times\\left(\\frac{3b}{a}\\right)^{2}$",
 "choices": [],
 "answer": "⑴ $21x^{3}y^{2}$ ⑵ $-4x^{4}y^{6}$ ⑶ $6a^{3}b$ ⑷ $-72a^{4}b^{5}$",
 "solution": "⑴ $3\\times 7\\times x^{3}y^{2}=21x^{3}y^{2}$ ⑵ $-4\\times x\\times x^{3}\\times y^{4}\\times y^{2}=-4x^{4}y^{6}$ ⑶ $6ab^{5}\\times\\frac{a^{2}}{b^{4}}=6a^{3}b$ ⑷ $-8a^{6}b^{3}\\times\\frac{9b^{2}}{a^{2}}=-72a^{4}b^{5}$",
